pan></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><strong>3<sup>b</sup></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\">&gt;&nbsp;100</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\">12%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\">52%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">4</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 99.25pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" rowspan=\"4\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&gt;&nbsp;5</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&le;&nbsp;20</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">0%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">50%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">5</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&gt;&nbsp;20 to &le;&nbsp;50</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">16%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">73%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">6<sup>a</sup></span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&gt;&nbsp;50 to &le;&nbsp;100</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">55%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">85%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">6<sup>b</sup></span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 77.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&gt;&nbsp;100</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">86%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 88.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"118\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210070831;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">90%</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Defined as metastasis or death due to disease. <sup>b</sup>Prognostic assessment of GISTs of all non-gastric sites can follow the criteria for small bowel GISTs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Data are based on reference <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{17193820}</span>.</p>",
